  "content": "<h1>Not Enough HUD Veltium</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/56455ba779e13a5d5d7ee80f927aa15a861952b3.png\" alt=\"Replace this with a description\"></p>\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<p><strong>全新 HUD</strong>，設計簡潔易讀</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FPS 計數器</li>\n<li>記憶體使用量監控</li>\n<li>座標顯示</li>\n<li>Ping 指示器</li>\n<li>即時時間顯示</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/dVSqczYj/2025-07-06-18-43-10-1.png\" alt=\"預設設定\"></p>\n<h2>相依性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib (YACL)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>選配</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></li>\n</ul>",
